\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Wafaa Anh</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Business Intelligence</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Project Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Fionnuala Samad</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Director of Research &amp; Analytics</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Divestiture Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Bilal Malone</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Treasury Operations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Valuation Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Internal Audit Plan for FY2008</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Internal Audit Plan for FY2008 was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with the Occupational Safety and Health Act (OSHA). The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s safety record and confirmed that it was in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for implementation:</strong> RESOLVED, that the SEC Comment Letter Response Committee declares a quarterly dividend of $74 per share, payable on 2008-10-16 to shareholders of record as of 2008-12-28.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Cuong Prince &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Wafaa Anh</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review, a proposal to adopt a new policy on corporate political activity. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for corporate reputation:</strong> RESOLVED, that the SEC Comment Letter Response Committee approves the company&#x27;s response to the shareholder proposal regarding Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Carol Prince &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Fionnuala Samad</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Retention Program — Key Employee Identification</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Retention Program — Key Employee Identification was a review of the company&#x27;s performance against its ESG goals. Takeshi White reported that the company had met 74 of its 44 targets for the year. The committee discussed strategies for addressing the shortfalls.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Director Independence Assessment</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the Director Independence Assessment, a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with trademark laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s brand portfolio and confirmed that it was in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To proceed:</strong> RESOLVED, that the SEC Comment Letter Response Committee approves the recommended approach to Director Independence Assessment as described in Exhibit D, subject to legal review to be completed within 15 days of this meeting.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Gulsen Mcfadden &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Wafaa Anh</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Finalize the performance metrics for the 2008 executive incentive plan</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Pinar Lange</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2008-11-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a report on the company&#x27;s progress on its quality management initiatives</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Preston Ray</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2008-11-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Provide a detailed budget breakdown for the proposal in Exhibit C</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Darius Winters</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2008-11-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 3:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2008-11-14</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Bilal Malone</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Director of Treasury Operations, Valuation Advisor (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2008/10/15/physical-security-access-control-system-audit-log-6761/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2008/10/16/vendor-contract-renewal-3345/multiple-regression-pay-gap-analysis-9922/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt 